{"name": "Dead Grid", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/311086e0e77e16e90b950cd6f6e8b40e.poster.avif?t=1789148257\" width=\"880\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/311086e0e77e16e90b950cd6f6e8b40e.webm?t=1789148257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/311086e0e77e16e90b950cd6f6e8b40e.mp4?t=1789148257\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/1606890130eee1f83be33cccbb1e6c8f.poster.avif?t=1789148257\" width=\"880\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/1606890130eee1f83be33cccbb1e6c8f.webm?t=1789148257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/1606890130eee1f83be33cccbb1e6c8f.mp4?t=1789148257\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/d8662b30423a62c1e0d5e76908980abe.poster.avif?t=1789148257\" width=\"880\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/d8662b30423a62c1e0d5e76908980abe.webm?t=1789148257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/d8662b30423a62c1e0d5e76908980abe.mp4?t=1789148257\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit a squad of elite mercenaries, experts in post-apocalyptic zombie combat. Battle hordes of the dead as you explore a 3D world revealed through the cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/ca7b0710d41815761c7190c76103a1f5.avif?t=1789148257\" width=\"616\"/></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Go silent and keep the noise down, picking off enemies one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Go loud with guns and explosives, drawing the dead at a rapid pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Set them on fire or blow them up. Slice and dice your orchestrated zombie funeral.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/a58dadf32201560924610e32cf1b4f26.avif?t=1789148257\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb 16 mercenary characters, each individually voiced with different personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb 5 classes with 115 unique skills and special passive perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u00bb Unlimited skill respec for endless experimentation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Reanimate the dead to  transform into a special class, called Revenant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb 17 character specific attributes to fine-tune the combat style even further. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb 370 Steam achievements, view progression directly in the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb 7 challenge modes with Leaderboards to replay the game with alternative rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb New Game+ mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f6d736d466278a373379379a51f22e77.avif?t=1789148257\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Find and upgrade hundreds of weapons, consumables and gadgets for your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Over 150 unique items that enhance your skills and transform your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Meet survivors to join your camp, where they\u2019ll assist you in future missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00bb Complete 42 side missions with bonus rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/extras/f1ff903f6b136b66555944cabb6075d0.webp?t=1789148257\" width=\"616\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Dead Grid is a turn-based strategy game set in a post-apocalyptic world overrun by zombies, infused with an 80s retro vibe. Lead a squad of elite mercenaries, fight relentless hordes, discover survivors, and build up your camp with hundreds of scavenged upgrades.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533680/7325d20dbedba7d729d0dfec0debafcb38034c91/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1789148257", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Tactical RPG", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Board Game", "Strategy RPG", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Party-Based RPG"], "developers": "Atom Void", "publishers": "Atom Void", "release_date": "Feb 4, 2026", "price": "$12.99", "appid": "1533680", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "11 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/82zyguMAoms", "first_seen": 1789077600.0, "review_rank": 0}